{"unit_id":"waterha__dsh-pintop#card-zh","repo":"waterha/dsh-pintop","commit":"13fd910ed40bb22d9178dde88836c275d2dce510","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pintop 是一款面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的 Windows 窗口置顶插件。它在左侧边栏底部加入置顶按钮，并通过本机窗口控制脚本读取和切换 Harness 窗口的置顶状态。按钮会显示当前状态，支持展开和收起侧栏时的不同显示方式，也会在窗口重新获得焦点后刷新状态。适合希望让 Harness 窗口始终显示在其他窗口上方的 Windows 用户。运行需要 Windows 和 PATH 中的 PowerShell 7；默认使用当前 Harness 可执行文件路径，也可配置 executablePath 或 DSH_PINTOP_EXECUTABLE。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:11-16","lib/client.js:75-101","lib/host.js:138-157","native/pintop.ps1:49-70"]}
{"unit_id":"waterha__dsh-pintop#card-en","repo":"waterha/dsh-pintop","commit":"13fd910ed40bb22d9178dde88836c275d2dce510","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pintop adds a sidebar button to pin or unpin the DeepSeek Harness window on Windows. It reads the confirmed state and refreshes it when the window regains focus. Requires Windows and PowerShell 7 on PATH; uses the current Harness executable by default, with optional path configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:11-16","lib/client.js:75-101","lib/host.js:138-157","native/pintop.ps1:49-70"]}
